# Universal Bug Bounty Recon & Subdomain Enumeration Rules
# Implements Jason Haddix TBHM v4 50-Item Subdomain Enumeration Methodology

When executing reconnaissance, subdomain discovery, or attack surface mapping:
- Refer to the master skill: `.agents/skills/subdomainenum/SKILL.md`
- Track the 50 checks using: `.agents/skills/subdomainenum/references/checklist_50_tracker.md`
- Utilize the 6 modular subagents under `.agents/skills/subdomainenum/subagents/`
- Prioritize high-fidelity resolution with wildcard filtering and multi-resolver pools.
